OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fsoon clear from southeast England to
OL,7,Fleave many areas dry overnight.
OL,8,FAlthough breezy, it will turn chilly
OL,9,Funder the clear periods, with a touch
OL,10,Fof frost in the north. A few showers
OL,11,Ffeeding in from the north too.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FAfter a chilly start, any
OL,14,Fshowers will die out to leave plenty
OL,15,Fof sunshine in the morning, with
OL,16,Flighter winds. However, wet and windy
OL,17,Fweather gradually arriving in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
